  <para style="toc2">Kolose</para>
  <para style="toc3">Kol</para>
  <para style="mt1">Kolose bi</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="COL 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1-2" style="v" sid="COL 1:1-2" />Paulo nɛ ji Yesu Kristo tsɔlɔ nɛ Mawu hla a, kɛ wa nyɛmi Timoteo nɛ ngma womi nɛ ɔ ya ha Mawu nimli nɛ ji nyɛmimɛ Kristo se nyɛɛli anɔkualetsɛmɛ ngɛ Kolose ke:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="COL 1:1-2">Dloomi kɛ he jɔmi nɛ je wa Tsɛ Mawu ɔ dɛ mi ɔ ha nyɛ. <verse eid="COL 1:1-2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="COL 1:3" />Wa naa Mawu, wa Mawetsɛ Yesu Kristo Tsɛ ɔ si daa kɛ haa nyɛ ngɛ wa sɔlemi mi, <verse eid="COL 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="COL 1:4" />ejakaa wa nu hemi kɛ yemi nɛ nyɛ ngɛ ngɛ Nutsɔ ɔ mi kɛ suɔmi nɛ nyɛɛ kɛ suɔ e nimli ɔmɛ ɔ he. <verse eid="COL 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="COL 1:5" />Nɛ nyɛ ngɛ bua jɔmi nɛ ngɛ Hiɔwe ɔ blɔ hyɛe kɛ je benɛ a fiɛ Manye Munyu ɔ kɛ tsɔɔ nyɛ ɔ. <verse eid="COL 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="COL 1:6" />Manye Munyu nɛ ɔ nɔuu nɛ su nyɛ ngɔ ɔ, nɛ ngɛ gbɛe kɛ ngɛ fiae ngɛ je ɔ tsuo, nɛ e ngɛ klaahi tsakee ngɛ he tsuaa he kaa bɔ nɛ e tsake nyɛ hu ngɛ ligbi nɔ nɔuu nɛ nyɛ nu, nɛ nyɛ na le Mawu mi mi jɔmi agbo nɛ e ngɛ kɛ ha yayami peeli ɔ.<verse eid="COL 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="COL 1:7" />Epafra, wa huɛ kɛ ni tsulɔ nɛ ji Yesu Kristo sɔmɔlɔ anɔkualetsɛ nɛ kɛ Manye Munyu ɔ ba ha nyɛ ɔ, e ngɛ hiɛ ɔ nɛ e maa ye kɛ bua wɔ ngɛ nyɛ nane mi. <verse eid="COL 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="COL 1:8" />Lɛ ji nɔ nɛ ba bɔ wɔ suɔmi agbo nɛ Mumi Klɔuklɔu ɔ ha nyɛ kɛ ha ni kpahi ɔ. <verse eid="COL 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="COL 1:9" />Enɛ ɔ he je ɔ, kɛ je ligbi nɛ wa nu nyɛ he ɔ, wa jɔɔ we sɔlemi kɛ pɛɛ kpami kɛ nyɛ hami, kaa Mawu nɛ ye kɛ bua nyɛ nɛ nyɛɛ nu nɔ́ nɛ e ngɛ hlae nɛ nyɛɛ pee ɔ sisi. Nɛ wa biɔ lɛ nɛ e pee nyɛ mumi mi ni leli, <verse eid="COL 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="COL 1:10" />konɛ nyɛɛ ba nyɛ je mi bɔ nɛ maa sa Nutsɔ ɔ hɛ mi, nɛ nyɛɛ pee nihi kpakpa be fɛɛ be, nɛ nyɛɛ kase Mawu he ni be fɛɛ be nɛ nyɛɛ le lɛ saminya.<verse eid="COL 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="COL 1:11" />Wa sɔlemi kɛ pɛɛ kpami hu ji kaa nyɛ hyi tɔ kɛ e agbo jemi he wami kɛ e hɛ mi nyami ɔ, bɔ nɛ pee nɛ nyɛɛ ya nyɛ hɛ mi kɛ bua jɔmi ngɛ Nutsɔ ɔ mi bɔ fɛɛ bɔ nɛ e ma ji ha, <verse eid="COL 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="COL 1:12" />nɛ nyɛɛ na Tsɛ ɔ si, nɔ nɛ ha nɛ wa sa nihi nɛ yeɔ Mawu bimɛ a gbosi ni ɔ eko ngɛ e matsɛ yemi nɛ ji la a mi. <verse eid="COL 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="COL 1:13" />Ejakaa e kpɔ wɔ kɛ je diblii kɛ abosiami matsɛ yemi ɔ mi, nɛ e kɛ wɔ ba e suɔmi Bi ɔ matsɛ yemi ɔ mi, <verse eid="COL 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="COL 1:14" />nɔ nɛ kɛ e muɔ kpɔ wɔ nɛ e kɛ wa he yayami ɔmɛ tsuo ke wɔ ɔ.<verse eid="COL 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kristo ni tsumi ɔ he sane</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="COL 1:15" />Kristo hɛɛ Mawu nɛ a nɛ ɔ subai pɛpɛɛpɛ, nɛ lɛ ji bɔ nihi tsuo a Tɛte; <verse eid="COL 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="COL 1:16" />nɛ anɔkuale ɔ ji kaa Kristo nitsɛ ji nɔ nɛ bɔ nɔ tsuaa nɔ nɛ ngɛ hiɔwe kɛ zugba a nɔ, níhi nɛ a naa kɛ nihi nɛ a nɛ, mumi je ɔ kɛ e mi matsɛ yemihi, nɔ yemihi kɛ he blɔhi; Kristo nɛ bɔ ni nɛ ɔmɛ kulaa kɛ ha lɛ nitsɛ e he kɛ e hɛ mi nyami womi. <verse eid="COL 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="COL 1:17" />E ngɛ loko ji níhi kulaa ba, nɛ e he wami nya nɛ a ngɛ ngɛ. <verse eid="COL 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="COL 1:18" />Lɛ ji nɔmlɔ tso ɔ nɛ ji asafo ɔ nɛ e to sisi ɔ e yi. Lɛ ji ni gbogboehi a kpɛti nɔ kekle nɛ te si, nɛ e peeɔ kekle nɔ ngɛ nɔ tsuaa nɔ mi, <verse eid="COL 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="COL 1:19" />ejakaa e sa Mawu hɛ mi kaa bɔ nɛ e ngɛ kɛ pi si ɔ, e Bi ɔ hu nɛ e hi ja.<verse eid="COL 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="COL 1:20" />Kɛ gu nɔ́ nɛ e Bi ɔ tsu ɔ nɔ ɔ, Mawu je blɔ kɛ ha nɔ tsuaa nɔ nɛ ba e ngo, níhi nɛ ngɛ hiɔwe kɛ nihi nɛ ngɛ zugba a nɔ tsuo, ejakaa Kristo kɛ e sɛumi tso nɔ gbenɔ ɔ kpata Mawu kɛ nimli kɛ bɔ nihi kulaa a kpɛti. <verse eid="COL 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="COL 1:21" />Nyɛ nɛ be ko mi ɔ, nyɛ li Mawu ɔ hu piɛ he. Jamɛ a be ɔ mi ɔ, e he nyɛli ji nyɛ. Nyɛ juɛmi kɛ nɔ́ yayami peemi ɔmɛ gba nyɛɛ kɛ lɛ nyɛ kpɛti. Se amlɔ nɛ ɔ, e kpale nyɛ kɛ ba e ngɔ kaa e huɛhi. <verse eid="COL 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="COL 1:22" />E pee enɛ ɔ kɛ lɛ nitsɛ e gbenɔ ngɛ sɛumi tso ɔ nɔ. Kɛ gu enɛ ɔ nɔ ɔ, Kristo ngɔ nyɛ kɛ ba Mawu hɛ mi tutuutu. E kɛ nyɛ da si kaa ni klɔuklɔuhi ngɛ e hɛ mi nɛ piami ko loo nya pomi ko be nyɛ he. <verse eid="COL 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="COL 1:23" />Nɔ́ nɛ he hia ji kaa nyɛ he Anɔkuale nɛ ɔ nɛ nyɛɛ ye kɛ pi si, nɛ nyɛ he nɛ wa ngɛ Nutsɔ ɔ mi. Nɛ nyɛ he Manye Munyu ɔ nyɛɛ ye kaa Yesu gbo kɛ ha nyɛ, nɛ e ma he nyɛ yi wami. Enɛ ɔ ji bua jɔmi munyu nɛ a kɛ ba ha nyɛ ti nɔ fɛɛ nɔ, nɛ e ngɛ gbɛe kɛ ngɛ fiae ngɛ je ɔ mi tsuo. Nɛ ami Paulo hu e pee mi bua jɔmi kaa i fiɛ kɛ ha ni kpahi.<verse eid="COL 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="COL 1:24" />Ye ni tsumi ɔ eko ji kaa ma na amanehlu kɛ ha nyɛ; nɛ ye bua jɔɔ he, ejakaa i ngɛ yee kɛ ngɛ buae nɛ ma gbe Kristo amanehlu nɛ e na kɛ ha e Nɔmlɔ tso nɛ ji asafo ɔ nya.<verse eid="COL 1:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Laami sane ɔ je kpo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="COL 1:25" />Mawu tsɔ mi nɛ ma ba ye kɛ bua e asafo ɔ, nɛ ma je e laami blɔ nya tomi ɔ kpo kɛ tsɔɔ ma je li ɔmɛ. <verse eid="COL 1:25" /><verse number="26-27" style="v" sid="COL 1:26-27" />E ngɔ laami sane nɛ ɔ ngɔ to kɛ je blema kɛ yi nɔ ɔmɛ, se amlɔ nɛ ɔ, e sa e hɛ mi kaa e je kpo ngɔ tsɔɔ nihi nɛ suɔ lɛ nɛ a ngɛ kɛ ha lɛ ɔ; nɛ ni nami kɛ anunyami nɛ ngɛ e blɔ nya tomi ɔ mi ɔ, e ngɛ kɛ ha nyɛ ma je li ɔmɛ hu. Laami sane nɛ ɔ ji Kristo nɛ ngɛ nyɛ tsui mi ɔ pɛ ji nyɛ hɛ nɔ kami kɛ ha anunyami nɛ ɔ.<verse eid="COL 1:26-27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="COL 1:28" />Enɛ ɔ he je ɔ, wa fiɛɔ Kristo ngɛ he fɛɛ he kɛ haa nihi nɛ maa bu tue. Nɛ wa bɔɔ mɛ kɔkɔ nɛ wa tsɔɔ mɛ ni bɔ nɛ wa le. Wa suɔmi ji kaa wa kpaka nɔ tsuaa nɔ kɛ ba Mawu ngɔ nɛ e hi kɛ pi si ngɛ nɔ́ nɛ Kristo tsu kɛ ha nɔ fɛɛ nɔ ɔ he. <verse eid="COL 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="COL 1:29" />Enɛ ɔ he dengme i ngɛ gboe, nɛ ma nyɛ ma tsu ngɛ Kristo he wami nɛ ngɛ ni tsue ngɛ ye mi ɔ he.<verse eid="COL 1:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="COL 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="COL 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="COL 2:1" />I na nɛ nyɛɛ kɛ asafo ɔ nɛ ngɛ Laodikea kɛ huɛmɛ kpahi fuu nɛ a kɛ mi kpi hɛ mi kɛ hɛ mi hyɛ ɔ le nyɛ he dengme nɛ i ngɛ gboe ngɛ sɔlemi mi.<verse eid="COL 2:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="COL 2:2" />I ngɛ sɔlee ha nyɛ kaa a wo nyɛ he wami nɛ nyɛɛ pee kake ngɛ suɔmi mi nɛ nyɛɛ le Kristo kɛ juɛmi nɛ mi tsɔ kɛ pi si. Nɛ Kristo nitsɛ ji Mawu laami sane ɔ nɛ jehanɛ ɔ a je kpo ɔ nɛ. <verse eid="COL 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="COL 2:3" />E mi nɛ a ngɔ juɛmi kɛ nile mi june ɔ tsuo kɛ laa ngɛ.<verse eid="COL 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nyɛɛ hɛɛ nyɛ hemi kɛ yemi ɔ mi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="COL 2:4" />I ngɛ nyɛ enɛ ɔ dee bɔ nɛ pee nɛ nɔ ko nɛ ko ba sisi nyɛ kɛ nya mi ngɔngɔɛ munyu. <verse eid="COL 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="COL 2:5" />E ngɛ mi kaa i kɛ nyɛ wa kpɛti kɛ mohu, se i kɛ nyɛ ngɛ ngɛ mumi mi, nɛ ye bua jɔɔ, ejakaa nyɛ ngɛ nɔ yae saminya nɛ nyɛ ngɛ hemi kɛ yemi nɛ mi wa ngɛ Kristo mi. <verse eid="COL 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="COL 2:6" />Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, akɛnɛ nyɛ he Kristo nɔ ye jehanɛ ɔ kaa e ma he nyɛ yi wami ɔ, nyɛ he e nɔ nɛ nyɛɛ ye hu kaa e maa ye kɛ bua nyɛ ngɛ nyɛ daa ligbi haomi ɔmɛ a mi nɛ nyɛɛ kɛ lɛ nɛ pee kake kpɛii. <verse eid="COL 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="COL 2:7" />Nyɛɛ hi si ngɛ e mi, nɛ nyɛ na nyɛ wami ngma kɛ je e mi, nɛ nyɛɛ ya nɔ nyɛɛ wa ngɛ e mi nɛ nyɛɛ kɛ nyɛ hɛ nɛ fɔ e nɔ be fɛɛ be, konɛ nyɛ he nɛ wa kpitikplii ngɛ anɔkuale ɔ nɛ a tsɔɔ nyɛ ɔ mi. Nɛ nyɛ hyi tɔ kɛ bua jɔmi, konɛ nyɛɛ na lɛ si babauu ngɛ níhi tsuo nɛ e tsu ha nyɛ ɔ he.<verse eid="COL 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="COL 2:8" />Nyɛɛ hyɛ nɛ hi nɛ, ngɛ nɔ́ nɛ Kristo de ɔ se ɔ, nɔ ko nɛ ko puɛ nyɛ bua jɔmi kɛ nyɛ hemi kɛ yemi ɔ kɛ je nɛ ɔ mi nile kɛ juɛmi. <verse eid="COL 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="COL 2:9" />Ejakaa bɔ nɛ Mawu su ngɛ ha a, wa naa ja a ngɛ Kristo Nɔmlɔ tso su mi. <verse eid="COL 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="COL 2:10" />Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, ke nyɛ ngɛ Kristo ɔ, nyɛ ngɛ nɔ́ tsuaa nɔ, nɛ nyɛ hyi tɔ kɛ Mawu, ngɛ nyɛɛ kɛ Kristo kake peemi mi. Lɛ ji nɔ́ yelɔ nɛ pe kulaa nɛ e ngɛ he wami nɛ eko kɛ lɛ sɔɛ.<verse eid="COL 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="COL 2:11" />Kristo mi nɛ a wo nyɛ nyumu mi ngɛ benɛ nyɛ ba e ngɔ ɔ, nyumu mi womi nɛ pi he lo blɔ fa mi nɔ, se mohu mumi mi nyumu mi womi nɛ je nyɛ kɛ je nyɛ yayami ɔmɛ a mi, nɛ e baptisi nyɛ klaa amɛ. <verse eid="COL 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="COL 2:12" />Kɛ gu baptisimi ɔ nɔ ɔ, nyɛ sa je mi bami yaya a gbo kɛ Kristo, nɛ a pu lɛ kɛ Kristo; nɛ jehanɛ ɔ a tle nyɛ kɛ lɛ tsuo si kɛ ba wami he mi, ejakaa nyɛ he Mawu Ope nɛ tle Kristo si kɛ je gbeje ɔ Munyu ɔ nyɛ ye.<verse eid="COL 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="COL 2:13" />Nyɛ he yayami ɔmɛ ha nɛ nyɛ gbo ngɛ mumi mi, nɛ nyɛ je mi bami yaya amɛ a se pui lolo. Kɛkɛ nɛ e ha nyɛ blɔ he ngɛ Kristo wami ɔ mi, ejakaa e ngɔ nyɛ he yayami ɔmɛ tsuo kɛ ke nyɛ, <verse eid="COL 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="COL 2:14" />nɛ e kita amɛ nɛ nyɛ yi nɔ, nɛ ji nyɛ nya pomi ɔmɛ ɔ, e po tsuo mi. E ngɔ nyɛ yayami nɛ ɔmɛ tsuo nɛ e ka kɛ wo Kristo sɛumi tso ɔ he nɛ e kpata a hɛ mi, nɛ tsɔɔ kaa a ngɔ nyɛ he yayami ɔmɛ kɛ ke nyɛ. <verse eid="COL 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="COL 2:15" />Kɛ gu enɛ ɔ nɔ́ ɔ, Mawu kpɔ Abosiami he wami nɛ e kɛ poo nyɛ nya ngɛ yayami he ɔ, nɛ Mawu je Kristo sɛumi tso nɔ kunimi yemi, he nɛ a je nyɛ he yayami ɔmɛ tsuo kɛ ho ngɛ ɔ, kɛ tsɔɔ je ɔ kulaa.<verse eid="COL 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="COL 2:16" />Enɛ ɔ he je ɔ, nyɛ ko ha nɛ nɔ ko nɛ kojo nyɛ ngɛ nɔ́ nɛ nyɛ yeɔ loo nyɛ nuu ɔ he, aloo ngɛ Yuda bi ɔmɛ a gbijlɔhi nɛ nyɛ yi, kɛ nyɔhiɔ he kusumi ɔmɛ loo hejɔɔmi ligbi ɔmɛ a he. <verse eid="COL 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="COL 2:17" />Ejakaa ni nɛ ɔmɛ ji mlaahi nɛ a pee kɛ ha be kpiti ko mi si himi, nɛ a se po ngɛ Kristo bami ɔ mi. A ji Kristo he nini kɛkɛ. <verse eid="COL 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="COL 2:18" />Nyɛ ko ha nɛ nɔ ko nɛ e ngɔ nyɛ kaa nihi nɛ laa, ke nyɛ sɔmɔ we bɔfohi kaa bɔ nɛ a ke nyɛɛ pee ɔ. A deɔ ke a na ngɛ nina mi nɛ e sa kaa nyɛɛ pee. Kikɛmɛ a fĩali nɛ ɔmɛ, nɛ mɛɛ a deɔ ke he si bali ji mɛ ɔ, ngɛ nɔ kalemi he juɛmi nɛ nya wa. <verse eid="COL 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="COL 2:19" />Se a kɛ Kristo nɔ nɛ ji wɔ tsuo wa yi ɔ be nɔ́ ko peemi. Kristo pani ɔmɛ tsa wɔ tsuo kɛ pee kake, nɛ wa waa kɛ guɔ niye ni kɛ he wami nɛ wa naa kɛ jee Mawu dɛ mi ɔ mi.<verse eid="COL 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="COL 2:20" />Ke nyɛɛ kɛ Kristo gbo nɛ lɔ ɔ ha nyɛ ye nyɛ he kɛ je je nɛ ɔ sisije blɔ nya tomihi kɛ ha yi wami hemi ɔ mi ɔ, mɛni he je mɔ nɛ nyɛ ngɛ a se nyɛɛe kɛ sa, nɛ jamɛ a mlaa amɛ fi nyɛ kaa <verse eid="COL 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="COL 2:21" />nyɛ ko ye enɛ, nyɛ ko nu enɛ aloo nyɛ ko ta niye ni komɛ tete a he? <verse eid="COL 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="COL 2:22" />Jamɛ a mlaa amɛ ji nimli a ni tsɔɔmihi kɛkɛ, ejakaa a pee niye ni nɛ a ye. <verse eid="COL 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="COL 2:23" />Mlaa nɛ ɔmɛ ngɛ kaa nɔ́ nɛ a hi, ejakaa mlaahi kaa enɛ ɔmɛ hia suɔmi wawɛɛ, nɛ a woɔ he si bami nɛ nya wa kɛ baa nɔmlɔ tso ɔ nɔ, se a he be se nami kɛ ha nɔmlɔ je mi bami yaya tsakemi. A haa nɛ e woɔ e he nɔ mohu.<verse eid="COL 2:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="COL 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="COL 3" />
  <para style="s1">Nyɛ susu hiɔwe níhi a he</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="COL 3:1" />Akɛnɛ nyɛ ba wami mi ekohu ngɛ Kristo nɛ a tle si ke je gbeje he je ɔ, nyɛɛ ngɔ nyɛ he kɛ fɔ hiɔwe ni kpakpa amɛ kɛ bua jɔmi ɔ nɔ, he nɛ Kristo hii si kɛ agbo jemi kɛ he wami ngɛ Mawu hiɔ nine nɔ ngɛ ɔ. <verse eid="COL 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="COL 3:2" />Nyɛ susu níhi nɛ ngɛ Hiɔwe ɔmɛ a he, pi níhi nɛ ngɛ zugba a nɔ. <verse eid="COL 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="COL 3:3" />Je nɛ ɔ mi níhi nɛ ko pee nyɛ akɔnɔ hu, kaa bɔ nɛ nɔ gbogboe susuu we nɔ ko he hu ɔ; ejakaa nyɛ si himi nitsɛ ɔ ngɛ hiɔwe ngɛ Kristo kɛ Mawu ngɔ. <verse eid="COL 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="COL 3:4" />Nɛ benɛ Kristo, nɔ nɛ ji wa wami nitsɛ ɔ maa ba ekohu ɔ, nyɛɛ kɛ lɛ tsuo ma pue ngɛ e anunyami ɔ mi.<verse eid="COL 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="COL 3:5" />Enɛ ɔ he je ɔ, nyɛɛ ngmɛɛ zugba nɛ ɔ nɔ níhi nɛ ji yayami ɔ he; yayami nihi nɛ ji gbenɔ nɛ ngɛ nyɛ mi ɔ, ajuama bɔmi, mu ni tsumi, mi mi la, akɔnɔ yaya kɛ zo ni tsumihi; nyɛ ko sɔmɔ je nɛ ɔ mi ni kpakpa amɛ, ejakaa a ji wɔ jami. <verse eid="COL 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="COL 3:6" />Mawu mi mi fumi baa nihi nɛ tsuɔ ni nɛ ɔmɛ a nɔ. <verse eid="COL 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="COL 3:7" />Nyɛ peeɔ nɔ́ nɛ ɔmɛ benɛ nyɛ ngɛ nihi nɛ peeɔ jamɛ a ni nɛ ɔmɛ a kpɛti ɔ. <verse eid="COL 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="COL 3:8" />Se piɔ ji be nɛ sa kaa nyɛ sake ni yaya nɛ ɔmɛ kulaa kɛ pue he; níhi nɛ ji muklii mi fumi, ninyɛ, nɔ gbiɛmi kɛ munyu nɛ he tsɔ we tumi.<verse eid="COL 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="COL 3:9" />Nyɛ ko ye lakpa kɛ si nyɛ bi, ejakaa nyɛ je nyɛ su momo ɔ kɛ e ni peemi yaya amɛ ngɔ pue he nɛ e gbo. <verse eid="COL 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="COL 3:10" />Nyɛ plɛ nimli hehi nɛ ngɛ mɔde bɔe be fɛɛ be, nɛ nyɛɛ kase nɔ́ nɛ da, nɛ nyɛɛ hi kaa Kristo nɔ nɛ bɔ kikɛmɛ a nɔmlɔ he nɛ ɔ ngɛ nyɛ mi ɔ. <verse eid="COL 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="COL 3:11" />Ngɛ nɔmlɔ he nɛ ɔ mi ɔ, ma je no loo he kpa no nɛ nɔ ko ji, womi lelɔ loo blɔ nya nɛ nɔ ko hɛɛ he hia we. Nɔ́ nɛ he hia ji kaa nɔ ko le Kristo, nɛ Kristo ɔ ngɛ kɛ ha wɔ tsuo.<verse eid="COL 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="COL 3:12" />Akɛnɛ Mawu hla nyɛ, nɛ e pee nyɛ nimli hehi ngɛ suɔmi agbo nɛ e ngɛ kɛ ha nyɛ he je ɔ, nyɛ na mi mi jɔmi, mɔbɔ nami, he si bami, kpoo peemi kɛ tsui si tomi kɛ ha ni kpahi hu. E he hia we kaa nyɛ je nyɛ he si nɛ a na nyɛ, se nyɛɛ na nɔ́ ngɛ a he ngɛ kpoo peemi kɛ tsui si tomi mi. <verse eid="COL 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="COL 3:13" />Ke sane ko ba nyɛ kpɛti ɔ, nyɛ na tsui ha nyɛ si bi nɛ nyɛ kɛ pa nyɛ he. Kaa bɔ nɛ Nutsɔ ɔ kɛ pa nyɛ ɔ, ja a nɔuu nyɛ hu nyɛɛ ngɔ kɛ pa nyɛ si bi.<verse eid="COL 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="COL 3:14" />Se titli ɔ, nyɛ ha nɛ suɔmi nɛ fiɔ asafo mluku ɔ kulaa kɛ peeɔ kake ɔ nɛ kpaka nyɛ. <verse eid="COL 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="COL 3:15" />Nyɛ ha Kristo he jɔmi ɔ nɛ hi nyɛ tsui mi, ejakaa enɛ ɔ he nɛ a tsɛ nyɛ kɛ ba ngɛ kaa e Nɔmlɔ tso ɔ he níhi, nɛ nyɛɛ le si nami daa kɛ daa.<verse eid="COL 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="COL 3:16" />Nyɛ kai nihi nɛ Kristo tsɔɔ ɔ, nɛ nyɛ ha e munyu ɔmɛ a tsake nyɛ si himi mi nɛ nyɛɛ le ni, nɛ nyɛɛ tsɔɔ nyɛ he ni, nɛ nyɛ la yi jemi kɛ mumi mi lahi nɛ nyɛ kɛ je Mawu yi ngɛ nyɛ tsui mi. <verse eid="COL 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="COL 3:17" />Nɛ nɔ́ fɛɛ nɔ nɛ nyɛ ma de aloo nyɛ maa pee ɔ, nyɛɛ pee kulaa ngɛ Nutsɔ Yesu Kristo biɛ mi, nɛ nyɛɛ gu e nɔ kɛ na Mawu nɛ ji Tsɛ ɔ si.<verse eid="COL 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kristo se nyɛɛlɔ si himi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="COL 3:18" />Nyɛ yigbayi ɔmɛ, nyɛɛ ba nyɛ he si kɛ ha nyɛ huno ɔmɛ, ejakaa ja a ji bɔ nɛ Nutsɔ ɔ to kɛ ha nyɛ. <verse eid="COL 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="COL 3:19" />Nɛ nyɛ huno ɔmɛ, nyɛɛ suɔ nyɛ yi ɔmɛ nɛ nyɛ mi mi nɛ jɔ ha mɛ, nyɛ mi mi nɛ ko wo la kɛ wo mɛ, nɛ nyɛ ko wa mɛ yi mi.<verse eid="COL 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="COL 3:20" />Bimɛ, nyɛɛ bu nyɛ tsɛmɛ kɛ nyɛ nyɛmɛ be fɛɛ be, ejakaa ja a ji nɔ́ nɛ sa Nutsɔ ɔ hɛ mi. <verse eid="COL 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="COL 3:21" />Tsɛmɛ, nyɛ ko wo nyɛ bi ɔmɛ a muklii mi la tsɔ konɛ a he mi nɛ ko ko jɔ̃.<verse eid="COL 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="COL 3:22" />Sɔmɔli, nyɛɛ bu nyɛ zugba nɛ ɔ nɔ nutsɔ ɔmɛ tue be fɛɛ be, pi ngɛ hɛ mi suɔmi nya be mi nɛ a ngɛ nyɛ hyɛe, se be fɛɛ be. Nyɛɛ bu mɛ be fɛɛ be kɛ he si bami ngɛ suɔmi nɛ nyɛ ngɛ kɛ ha Nutsɔ ɔ he. <verse eid="COL 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="COL 3:23" />Nyɛɛ je nyɛ tsui mi kɛ tsu ni wawɛɛ be fɛɛ be kɛ bua jɔmi, kaa nɔ́ nɛ Nutsɔ ɔ nɛ nyɛ ngɛ tsue ha, se pi nyɛ zugba a nɔ nutsɔ ɔmɛ. <verse eid="COL 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="COL 3:24" />Nɛ nyɛ kai kaa Kristo, Nutsɔ ɔ, ji nɔ nɛ maa wo nyɛ hiɔ, nɛ e ma ha nyɛ nyɛ blɔ fa mi nɔ́ ɔ kulaa. Ejakaa lɛ ji nɔ nɛ nyɛ ngɛ ni ɔ tsue ha niinɛ. <verse eid="COL 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="COL 3:25" />Nɛ nɔ nɛ peeɔ níhi nɛ sɛ ɔ, e ma na níhi nɛ sɛ ɔ he hiɔwo, ejakaa Mawu hlɛ nimli a mi.<verse eid="COL 3:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="COL 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="COL 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="COL 4:1" />Nyɛ nutsɔ ɔmɛ, nyɛɛ pee nɔ́ nɛ da kɛ nɔ́ nɛ sa kɛ ha nyɛ sɔmɔli ɔmɛ, nɛ nyɛ kai be fɛɛ be kaa nyɛ hu nyɛ ngɛ Nutsɔ ngɛ Hiɔwe nɛ ngɛ nyɛ hyɛe.<verse eid="COL 4:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="COL 4:2" />Pɔ nɛ ko tɔ nyɛ he kɛ sɔlemi; nyɛɛ sɔle daa nɛ nyɛɛ fɔ nyɔ ngɛ he. Nyɛɛ hyɛ Mawu heto nɛ maa ba a blɔ, nɛ nyɛɛ na lɛ si ngɛ he. <verse eid="COL 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="COL 4:3" />Nyɛɛ sɔle kɛ ha wɔ hu konɛ Mawu nɛ ha wɔ he blɔ nɛ wa kɛ fiɛ Kristo Manye Munyu ɔ, nɔ́ he nɛ a wo mi tsu mi ngɛ hiɛ ɔ. <verse eid="COL 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="COL 4:4" />Nyɛɛ sɔle nɛ ma na kã kɛ fiɛ munyu ɔ paa kɛ faii bɔ nɛ sa.<verse eid="COL 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="COL 4:5" />Nyɛɛ nyɛɛ ngɛ ni lemi nya, ngɛ nihi nɛ he we yi ɔmɛ a he, nɛ nyɛ tsu nyɛ deka he ni kɛ fiɛ Manye Munyu ɔ kɛ tsɔɔ ni kpahi. <verse eid="COL 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="COL 4:6" />Nyɛ ha nɛ nyɛ munyu he nɛ tsɔ, bɔ nɛ pee nɛ nyɛ munyuhi a heto hami nɛ da kɛ ha nɔ tsuaa nɔ.<verse eid="COL 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nyagbe sɛ yemi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="COL 4:7" />Tihiko, wa suɔlɔ kɛ sɔmɔlɔ kpakpa ngɛ Nutsɔ ɔ mi ɔ, maa bɔ nyɛ bɔ nɛ i ngɛ nɔ yae ha. E tsuɔ ni wawɛɛ nɛ e kɛ mi sɔmɔɔ Nutsɔ ɔ. <verse eid="COL 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="COL 4:8" />I je blɔ tsɔ lɛ nyɛ ngɔ nɛ e ba hyɛ bɔ nɛ nyɛ ngɛ ha konɛ e wo nyɛ bua kɛ he wami. <verse eid="COL 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="COL 4:9" />I ngɛ Onesimo, anɔkualetsɛ kɛ wa suɔlɔ nyɛmi nɛ je nyɛ kpɛti ɔ hu tsɔe. E kɛ Tihiko maa bɔ nyɛ wa hiɛ ɔ amaniɛ tsuo.<verse eid="COL 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="COL 4:10" />Aristarko, nɔ nɛ a wo lɛ hu tsu mi ngɛ hiɛ ɔ kɛ Marko nɛ ji Barnaba weku no ɔ ke a biɔ nyɛ. Nɛ kaa bɔ nɛ i de nyɛ momo ɔ, ke Marko ba nyɛ ngɔ ɔ, nyɛ he lɛ atuu. <verse eid="COL 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="COL 4:11" />Yesu Yusto hu ke e biɔ nyɛ. Ni nɛ ɔmɛ pɛ ji Yuda bi Kristo se nyɛɛli nɛ a kɛ mi ngɛ ni tsue ngɛ hiɛ ɔ, nɛ a haa mi bua jɔmi saminya.<verse eid="COL 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="COL 4:12" />Epafra nɛ ji Kristo Yesu sɔmɔlɔ nɛ je nyɛ ma a mi ɔ ke e biɔ nyɛ. E sɔleɔ kɛ haa nyɛ daa ngɛ anɔkuale mi nɛ e biɔ Mawu nɛ e ha nyɛ he wami nɛ nyɛɛ hi kɛ pi si, nɛ e ye kɛ bua nyɛ nɛ nyɛɛ le e suɔmi nya ni ngɛ nɔ́ tsuaa nɔ mi. <verse eid="COL 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="COL 4:13" />I ngɛ e he odase yee kaa e gboɔ dengme ngɛ nyɛ kɛ Kristo se nyɛɛli nɛ ngɛ Laodikea kɛ Hierapoli ɔmɛ a he ngɛ e sɔlemihi a mi.<verse eid="COL 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="COL 4:14" />Luka, tsopatsɛ nɛ a suɔ lɛ ɔ, kɛ Dema ke a biɔ nyɛ.<verse eid="COL 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="COL 4:15" />I biɔ Kristo se nyɛɛli nɛ ngɛ Laodikea a, kɛ Nimfa kɛ asafo nɛ kpee ngɛ e we ɔ mi ɔ. <verse eid="COL 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="COL 4:16" />Ke nyɛ kane womi nɛ ɔ, nyɛ ha nɛ a kane ngɛ Laodikea asafo ɔ mi hulɔ; nɛ nyɛ hu nyɛɛ kane Laodikea bi ɔmɛ a womi ɔ nɛ i ngma mɛ ɔ. <verse eid="COL 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="COL 4:17" />Nɛ nyɛ de Arkipo ke, “Hyɛ nɛ o tsu ni tsumi fɛɛ ni tsumi nɛ Nutsɔ ɔ ngɔ wo o dɛ ɔ.”<verse eid="COL 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="COL 4:18" />Ami Paulo nitsɛ ye nine nya womi nɛ i kɛ ngɛ nyɛ ngae ji nɛ ɔ nɛ. Nyɛ kai mi ngɛ tsu ɔ mi ngɛ hiɛ ɔ. Mawu dloomi ɔ kɛ nyɛ nɛ hi si.<verse eid="COL 4:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="COL 4" />
</usx>